Drop the real penguin asset here as `penguin.png` (the Wave penguin with a basket
of vegetables on its head — used as the wheel hub).

A placeholder SVG (`penguin-placeholder.svg`) is referenced by the components for
local development. To use the real asset:

  1. Save the official PNG as `public/penguin.png`
  2. The Wheel component already references `/penguin.png` — no code change needed

Recommended: square crop, transparent background, ≥256×256.
